M4 comparison between TYPES: for residues r,s define
  win(r,s) = #{a: depth_r(a) > depth_s(a)} - #{a: depth_s(a) > depth_r(a)}
Build the TYPE tournament; check transitivity / 3-cycles.
  representative residues (one per type): [0, 1, 2, 7]
