CONSEQUENCE for regular class. A REGULAR tournament on 5 vertices needs
score (2,2,2,2,2): every vertex beats exactly 2. Check: can 5 speeds chosen
from these types ever give a regular M4 tournament? Exhaustive over residue
multisets (with multiplicity, since speeds can share a residue mod 14).

